workshop hummed with blinding violet light as Vanguard-Zero

805
00:30:47,140 --> 00:30:47,728
returned,

806
00:30:47,928 --> 00:30:49,740
bearing the key to the final gate.

807
00:30:50,570 --> 00:30:52,833
Ahead of us lay Floors Ninety-One through One

808
00:30:52,845 --> 00:30:53,308
Hundred,

809
00:30:53,458 --> 00:30:55,520
where the true architect of this broken world

810
00:30:55,533 --> 00:30:56,783
awaited our arrival.

811
00:30:57,602 --> 00:31:00,215
Seventy-two hours,' I murmured calmly,

812
00:31:00,340 --> 00:31:02,902
picking up my developer stylus with a confident,

813
00:31:03,052 --> 00:31:04,352
unwavering smile.

814
00:31:05,115 --> 00:31:07,465
More than enough time to rewrite reality.'